sequenceDiagram
  participant User as User
  participant CLI as deepagents_cli.execute_task
  participant Graph as LangGraph Agent
  participant LLM as ChatModel
  participant Tool as ToolNode/Tools

  User->>CLI: 输入一条消息
  CLI->>Graph: astream(messages+updates)
  Graph->>LLM: 模型调用
  LLM-->>Graph: 输出文本 + tool_calls（结构化）
  Graph->>Tool: 执行工具
  Tool-->>Graph: ToolMessage / Command(update=...)
  Graph-->>CLI: messages 流（可渲染）
  Graph-->>CLI: updates 流（todos / __interrupt__）
